      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: True dude unfortunately the option for that is not there I would like for a option to be added so I can add Krisp as a Speaker output for VR Chat to eliminate echo or for VR Chat to introduce their own echo cancellation settings.",
