  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-05-17T07:33:21.809Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hey guys I was wondering because I+Others I have talked to are having echo issues on our Microphones.\n\nI found Krisp and it has echo cancelling features but to turn that on You must enable the Krisp Speaker on VR chat too which does not work because We only see the option to change our default Microphones to Krisp.\n\nIf for some reason that is not able to be done which We don't hold any negative feelings about :) We would like for VR Chat to have its own echo cancellation feature in the settings to make communication through Microphones a more fun time for everyone",
